Sync the headers with the pog copy bundled in yaramod 4.8.3 (deps/pog),
which is what yaramod's own headers are written against:
- include <fmt/ranges.h> where fmt::join is used (needed with fmt >= 11)
- include <cassert> where assert() is used
- constrain Error's converting constructor
- Tokenizer: compare global token indices on equal matches, and stop on a
  zero-length match in the middle of the input instead of looping forever
Also make project VERSION match the release (it still said 0.5.2), so that
pog.pc and pog-config-version.cmake report 0.5.3.

